{"id":"01678cd990532be9","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-expcom-oracle.md","title":"指数时钟确定型接受预言机","display":"df-expcom-oracle — 指数时钟确定型接受预言机","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-expcom-oracle","aliases":["28-df-expcom-oracle"],"display":"df-expcom-oracle — 指数时钟确定型接受预言机","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-computation]]","[[28-df-godel-numbering]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Example 3.6(3); accepting-state clock variant","source_printed_pages":"74","source_pdf_pages":"100","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-expcom-oracle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-expcom-oracle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-expcom-oracle — 指数时钟确定型接受预言机"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b54d75aae768415e\" href=\"?note=b54d75aae768415e\" title=\"28-df-godel-numbering\">28-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Example 3.6(3); accepting-state clock variant"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"74"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"100"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>机器有效编码与元组编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b54d75aae768415e\" href=\"?note=b54d75aae768415e\" title=\"28-df-godel-numbering\">28-df-godel-numbering</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AccComp}_M,\\operatorname{len}\">\\(\\operatorname{AccComp}_M,\\operatorname{len}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EXPCOM}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner,x,1^n\\rangle:M\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*,\\ n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x)\\;\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)\\le2^n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EXPCOM}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner,x,1^n\\rangle:M\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*,\\ n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x)\\;\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)\\le2^n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>指数时钟参数采用一元编码；机器描述是实例的一部分。本地时钟检测进入接受状态；原书检测输出带结果1。任意本地机器的接受标签与输出带可以独立，因此这两种条件并非对同一码逐实例相同。可通过在停机前读取或写入判定位的标准机器转换对应两种表示，且精确时钟必须计入该转换开销；该语言总可判定，并非无界停机语言。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Example 3.6(3)；印刷 pp.74 / PDF pp.100。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n<p>R7复核：实际核对 Example 3.6(3)（PDF100）的输出1条件；本条明确为接受状态变体，不把机器规范化后的时间界当原机器的逐实例精确2^n界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b54d75aae768415e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b54d75aae768415e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"机器有效编码与元组编码见 [[28-df-godel-numbering]]；$\\operatorname{AccComp}_M,\\operatorname{len}$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"机器有效编码与元组编码见 [[28-df-godel-numbering]]；$\\operatorname{AccComp}_M,\\operatorname{len}$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{AccComp}_M,\\operatorname{len}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EXPCOM}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner,x,1^n\\rangle:M\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*,\\ n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x)\\;\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)\\le2^n\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1902,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-283","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy]]、[[28-cor-np-neq-nexp]]、[[28-df-expcom-oracle]]、[[28-prop-expcom-oracle-collapse]]。"},{"id":"d4dc334a9ae04367","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","256220eba4eba968","b54d75aae768415e"]}